{"id":"en_my-two-mates-never-loved-me","title":"My Two Mates Never Loved Me","titleEn":"My Two Mates Never Loved Me","description":"Evelyn remembers dying in a previous life: Alpha Caden and Beta Zane treated her as nothing more than a plaything for their cherished Sera, then abandoned her to wild wolves. Given a second chance, she removes every gift they gave her and escapes into the snow without shoes. Sera, seemingly flawless, is revealed to be Asher, a male warrior living under disguise, who gives up years of his own life to rescue Evelyn. Just as she begins to love him, Caden and Zane come pleading for forgiveness, but Asher's sacrifice leaves him dead young. Evelyn must now decide whether she can avenge him and free herself from the two Alphas.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-two-mates-never-loved-me/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-two-mates-never-loved-me/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d417o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-two-mates-never-loved-me_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d417o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-two-mates-never-loved-me_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d417o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-two-mates-never-loved-me_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d417o/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-two-mates-never-loved-me_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sou